# Admin UI

## Settings (`/admin/settings`)

- Master-only; tabs: business, theme, bookings, messages, payments
- Use existing `SettingsToggle`, `SettingsFeatureRow`, `SettingsInfoTip` for compact layout
- Long explanations go in info icons, not inline paragraphs
- Messages tab uses `NotificationMessagesEditor`; state from `resolveNotificationMessages(null)` on init

## Calendar (`/admin/calendar`)

- Master can filter by technician (“Everyone” or one person)
- Time off blocks include `technician.name` from blocks API
- **Month grid**: generic “Time off” label on violet days
- **Day detail panel**: show technician name + time range; Remove only for own blocks

## Staff working hours

- Owner: Staff (`/admin/technicians`) → **Hours** on each tech card (compact Mon–Sun rows, Off toggle, Open/Close)
- Tech: **My hours** (`/admin/hours`) — same editor for own schedule
- Stored on `Technician.workingHours`; booking slots / waitlist use per-day hours (null = salon open/close)

## Bookings settings

- `waitlistEnabled`, `rebookReminderEnabled`, `rebookReminderDaysAfter` (7–365, default 21)

## Mobile

- Touch-friendly targets, collapsible message groups default closed
